    },
    "VibeRes also checks once a day in the background. Brew users can run `brew upgrade --cask m-moravcik/viberes/viberes-app` to install the new build.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VibeRes prüft außerdem einmal täglich im Hintergrund. Brew-Nutzer können `brew upgrade --cask m-moravcik/viberes/viberes-app` ausführen, um den neuen Build zu installieren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VibeRes also checks once a day in the background. Brew users can run `brew upgrade --cask m-moravcik/viberes/viberes-app` to install the new build."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VibeRes navyše kontroluje raz denne na pozadí. Používatelia brew môžu nový build nainštalovať príkazom `brew upgrade --cask m-moravcik/viberes/viberes-app`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When both HiDPI and native modes exist for the size, prefer the HiDPI variant.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn es für die Größe HiDPI- und native Modi gibt, die HiDPI-Variante bevorzugen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When both HiDPI and native modes exist for the size, prefer the HiDPI variant."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keď pre danú veľkosť existujú HiDPI aj natívne režimy, preferovať HiDPI variantu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you plug or unplug a monitor, VibeRes finds the saved profile that best fits the new layout and applies it silently. Mode-only changes don't trigger this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn du einen Monitor anschließt oder trennst, findet VibeRes das passendste gespeicherte Profil und wendet es lautlos an. Reine Auflösungsänderungen lösen das nicht aus."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you plug or unplug a monitor, VibeRes finds the saved profile that best fits the new layout and applies it silently. Mode-only changes don't trigger this."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keď pripojíš alebo odpojíš monitor, VibeRes nájde uložený profil, ktorý najlepšie vyhovuje novému usporiadaniu, a tichu ho použije. Zmeny iba režimu (rozlíšenia) tento mechanizmus nespustia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which display hosts the menu bar after this profile is applied. 'Don't change' leaves the arrangement alone.": {
      "comment": "Tooltip for the main-display picker in the Save/Edit form",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcher Bildschirm nach dem Anwenden des Profils die Menüleiste trägt. „Nicht ändern“ lässt die Anordnung unberührt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which display hosts the menu bar after this profile is applied. 'Don't change' leaves the arrangement alone."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ktorý displej bude po použití profilu niesť lištu menu. „Nemeniť“ ponechá rozloženie tak, ako je."
          }
        }
      }
    },
